  "question": {
    "text": "Sodium metal crystallises in a body centred cubic lattice with unit cell edge length of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#197;</mi></math>. The radius of sodium atom is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#197;</mi></math>. (Nearest integer)",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "17",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Edge length of the unit cell <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup><mi>cm</mi></math></p><p>Radius of sodium atom <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>?</mo></math></p><p>Since, sodium&nbsp;crystallises in body&nbsp;centered cubic arrangement.</p><p>The radius of the atom and the edge length of the cubic unit cell are related as follows,</p><p>For bcc structure,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>732</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>732</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>17</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#197;</mi></math>.</p>",
